cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BioAvanceD ex-ante evaluation evidence package (BLPP + lab evaluation artefacts)"
message: "If you use this evidence package or the BioAvanceD Lab Population Pattern (BLPP), please cite it using these metadata."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Ribeiro
    given-names: Denise
    email: denise.ribeiro@mail.usf.edu.br
    affiliation: "Universidade São Francisco (USF)"
version: "ex-ante-evaluation-v1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
abstract: >-
  Design Science Research ex-ante evaluation package for BioAvanceD-v2:
  Fase 2 full-lab reference population memo, Fase 3 evaluation evidence
  (capacity, what-if, AIR/LGPD, RIPD lab, STRIDE, TCO, cognitive walkthrough,
  UI screenshots, RCS/liberação), and the BioAvanceD Lab Population Pattern
  (BLPP) synthetic seed pipeline. Lab data are synthetic (VAL-027); no real PII.
keywords:
  - biobank
  - Design Science Research
  - synthetic data
  - LGPD
  - BioAvanceD
  - BLPP
